      "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate released GBP 95.7 million of gross technical reserves in 2015, primarily driven by favourable claims development on attritional losses. This release predominantly impacted the Energy, Casualty, and Treaty Divisions. In 2014, a release of GBP 77.4 million was observed, mainly affecting the Marine, Property, and Treaty Divisions. Several named catastrophe events occurred in 2015, including Hurricane Patricia, winter storms in the US/Canada, European floods, and the Tianjin Port explosions. Prior year events from 2014, such as heavy snowfall in Japan, US hailstorms/tornadoes, and Hurricane Odile, had losses below GBP 10m with little change in estimated net loss during 2015.",
